  "description": "A special type of tea grows in the woods of Zarakkar. It grants longevity and heals the most dangerous wounds. Guarded by the Foremother, ancient forebear to all tortoises, the marvelous tea had been hidden from human sight until a young woman named Martha received its gift, paying an enormous price in return.",
  "battle_line": "back",
  "presentation": "Martha is the best group healer",
  "strengths": [
    "High healing.",
    "Great survivability. She can withstand enemies targeting the back line (Cleaver, Jhu, Kayla, Jorgen, Luther).",
    "Boosts her team's speed, greatly increasing damage regardless of its type.",
    "A great choice for defense teams and against Osh, the boss in Asgard."
  ],
  "weaknesses": [
    "Heroes that block healing (Celeste, Jet, Yasmine, Biscuit) can reduce Martha's effectiveness.",
    "Heroes that deal area damage can destroy Martha's healing totem. Cleaver can also reduce Martha's effectiveness by moving her forward and leaving the back line vulnerable."
  ],
